    360  0aee							;------------------------------------------------------------- interrupts
    361  0aee							; Every 1/4 ms: take a MIDI-in byte, feed the ACIA one byte (fast path).
    362  0aee							; Every fourth time (1 ms):
    363  0aee							; count a tick and move paced messages onto the wire.
