    359  72a7							; ------------------------------------------------------------ One Key Play
    360  72a7							; CRSR DOWN or CRSR RIGHT (A = 1 / 2: which) pressed, ONE KEY PLAY on: the
    361  72a7							; phrase's next step sounds. PENTATONIC PAIRS: two notes of the key's
    362  72a7							; pentatonic scale, one apart (a third or a fourth), across the overlay's two
    363  72a7							; octaves. CHORD NOTES: one note of the chord (the keys held or latched),
    364  72a7							; over two octaves. EACH PRESS CUTS the last step or lets it RING ON (until
    365  72a7							; the next). The notes sound while either key is down (latch: until the next
    366  72a7							; press).
    367  72a7				   OkpPress
    368  72a7					      subroutine
    369  72a7		       0d 46 cd 	      ora	okpDown
    370  72aa		       8d 46 cd 	      sta	okpDown
